{"version":1,"content":"<p>33歲前日本AV女優、DJ的濱崎真緒「DJ Mao」周日（11月1日）凌晨在尖沙嘴一派對場所飲用一杯飲料後不適，其經理人懷疑飲料遭落藥。</p><p>警方油尖警區刑事偵緝支援隊昨日（2日）在中區拘捕一名61歲男子，他涉嫌意圖損害等而施用毒藥等，正被扣留調查。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:43:06.579524+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:08:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:38:44.477845+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:38:48.687296+00:00","content_hash":"a8b46c107c957c0fa1e4140c4446d83ee42b5666e6ce79b0f10186137169bbe4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}